<h1>ZeParty — Master Technical Audit & Bug Resolution Report</h1>

<div class="header-meta">
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td class="meta-label">Project:</td>
      <td>ZeParty Audio & Live Streaming Mobile Application</td>
