      <td>November 3, 2026</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="meta-label">Frontend Stack:</td>
      <td>Flutter (Dart), Provider Architecture, Agora RTC</td>
      <td class="meta-label">Backend Stack:</td>
      <td>Node.js, Express, Socket.IO, PostgreSQL (Prisma), Redis</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="meta-label">Audit Scope:</td>
      <td>Live Party Rooms, PK Arena, Stage Mics, User Profile & Economy</td>
      <td class="meta-label">Final Status:</td>
