    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<h2>1. Executive Summary</h2>
<p>
This official engineering document provides a complete technical audit and resolution report for all defects reported across the ZeParty application.
The audit and implementation encompassed room UI layering, real-time WebSocket event dispatching, audience presence eviction, microphone stage invitation workflows, profile asset mapping, economy safeguards, and the complete elimination of synthetic/dummy broadcasters in competitive PK matches.
</p>
<p>
All changes have been developed in strict accordance with the existing system architecture, design specifications, and business rules. Both the mobile client and backend services have undergone static analysis and multi-device socket verification with <b>zero errors</b>.
</p>

